{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/baff3c229f9c6b156950522be6dab89d.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophers already waste their time and lives thinking about thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not have fun while doing it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.poster.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.webm?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.mp4?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trolley Solution</strong> is a compilation of minigames based on the famous trolley problem, originally proposed in 1967 by British philosopher Philippa Foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.poster.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.webm?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.mp4?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your thinking power to the test  in humorous iterations of the problem. Unlock a variety of minigames where you can put your gaming skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.poster.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.webm?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.mp4?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and learn important and useful philosophical knowledge while expanding your mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 trolley problem variations (plus the original)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 minigames inspired by each variation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: You might not actually learn anything useful or important, nor expand your mind, by playing this game.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Deontology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/384df0121487052c8aec06cb62cfc6bace2b83aa.jpg"},{"name":"Utilitarianism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/1e9dc17b9ae12fa76ad04cc6c39f438fc18c0134.jpg"},{"name":"True Deontologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/a941118ba834594356b2d1a0e4a114cd5f6028ac.jpg"},{"name":"True Utilitarian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/f4f3a25a5d834c692c50db901184953d124b4fdc.jpg"},{"name":"Philosopher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/976ffd89ad175eeb8fdf29be9f02f35075b72a24.jpg"},{"name":"Collateral Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/ba399a5c2581ce3bfc17729b4d8dcca2afbe0444.jpg"},{"name":"Epistemology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/699b9dc2d96c4ef726d1a494d1b21bad3bb27f7c.jpg"},{"name":"Omnibenevolist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/b3a9bf1fd456303e2e1fd8b254f638161f5654d9.jpg"},{"name":"Nescience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/bc521ba608410ad2df3648fedd2a4d4fdc50fb13.jpg"},{"name":"Romanticism","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3219410/e8aa54dec95eb50de98207b91d9ab9789053ce26.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3219410?t=1769932821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/5d8f5566efe2754b597218582b88da09e40d8b13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769932821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/aba7722c08df5f8c16ed7d8bd8aca2271a57ce34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769932821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/aba7722c08df5f8c16ed7d8bd8aca2271a57ce34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769932821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/baff3c229f9c6b156950522be6dab89d.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophers already waste their time and lives thinking about thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not have fun while doing it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.poster.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.webm?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/00f43c1494f13571f404844137e5d17a.mp4?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Trolley Solution</strong> is a compilation of minigames based on the famous trolley problem, originally proposed in 1967 by British philosopher Philippa Foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.poster.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.webm?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/b1097ba16ab9c7cd45e8b344cd94187b.mp4?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your thinking power to the test  in humorous iterations of the problem. Unlock a variety of minigames where you can put your gaming skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.poster.avif?t=1769932821\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.webm?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/extras/d8ccfb3daa059203ae9407fb68301719.mp4?t=1769932821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and learn important and useful philosophical knowledge while expanding your mind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 trolley problem variations (plus the original)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 minigames inspired by each variation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: You might not actually learn anything useful or important, nor expand your mind, by playing this game.</i></p>","developers":["byDanDans"],"dlc":[3550600],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3219410/795fb098d0271a0e663e9cc677ee22cbc5abfa99/header.jpg?t=1769932821","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\